null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_7","text":"It took some getting used to, but I think I'm there.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_8","text":"You've adapted faster than I thought.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_9","text":"I didn't think wielding a weapon capable of causing corrosion would be easy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_10","text":"Mmm, even though I'm immune to the powder,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_11","text":"I was worried that if I used it too much, I might start to corrode too.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_12","text":"But the more I used it, the more natural it felt.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_13","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_13","text":"*Caw*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_14","text":"This feather ball is starting to grow on me too.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_15","text":"I'm glad you've adapted well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_16","text":"Actually, I'm still a bit bewildered.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_17","text":"When I took your test that day, I thought I was going to die without even getting the chance to do anything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_18","text":"I can't believe I'm still alive.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_19","text":"You have every right to be proud of yourself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_20","text":"We've had innumerable Nikkes undergo this test,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_21","text":"and you're the first to pass and enter this place.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_22","text":"Heh... I see.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_23","text":"I thought I'd spend the rest of my life wandering aimlessly with a half-broken core until the day I die.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_24","text":"To have been given a second chance at life is thrilling indeed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_25","text":"Now that you've mentioned it, your core is damaged?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_26","text":"Yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_27","text":"How did that come about?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_28","text":"It's pretty much the same old story.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_29","text":"An ordinary Nikke who once admired the Goddesses of Victory,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_30","text":"traveling up to the surface, blinded by the noble cause of reclaiming it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_31","text":"I burned my life away in battle and damaged my core.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_32","text":"When my so-called comrades found out,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_33","text":"they used me as bait for the Raptures and ran away.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_34","text":"!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_35","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_36","text":"It's a common occurrence.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_37","text":"You've never thought about seeking revenge?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_38","text":"Of course I have.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_39","text":"At first, my mind was consumed purely by the instinct to survive,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_40","text":"just so I could demand an explanation from my so-called comrades.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_41","text":"That thought was what kept me going and helped me stay alive.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_42","text":"However,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_43","text":"when I finally found them,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_44","text":"they had become bait themselves and were completely wiped out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_45","text":"They were holding nothing but their radios, clenched tightly in their hands. The same ones that had sent countless distress calls to the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_eden_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_eden_02_46","text":"It was then that I finally realized:","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_ed